  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<section>\n<section>\n<div>\n<p><strong>這個模組為所有叢林生物群落添加了一座大型樹屋村莊，內有各種職業的村民。</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1256/45/treehouse.png\" width=\"385\"></strong><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1256/46/blacksmith.png\" width=\"385\"></p>\n<p>探索這座建築，發現隱藏的箱子、珍貴的戰利品以及裝飾精美的內部空間。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1256/48/inside2.png\" width=\"385\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1256/49/upstairs.png\" width=\"385\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>歡迎在您的整合包中使用此模組。</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
